{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17565","headline":"和段相公登武担寺西台 · 温会","name":"和段相公登武担寺西台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桑台烟树中，台榭造云空。\n眺听逢秋兴，篇辞变国风。\n坐愁高鸟起，笑指远人同。\n始愧才情薄，跻攀继韵穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温会","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17565.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17565","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}